sentences.text:
Thus the position is that the petitioners on one hand and respondent No.7 on the other hand have made claims for receipt of the 12 August, 2024 1WP12666-23.DOC compensation amount and it is in these circumstances, the present petition has been filed making the following prayers:-
"(a) By an appropriate writ, order or direction of this Hon'ble Court, impugned Order dated 7th August, 2023 passed by the Respondent No. 2, thereby rejecting Petitioners objection, be quashed and set aside;
(b) By an appropriate writ, order or direction of this Hon'ble Court, to the Respondent No.2 to refer the Petitioners Dispute/objection to the Authority under the provision of Section 64 of Right to Fair Compensation & Transparency &
Resettlement Act, 2013;
(c) By an appropriate writ, order or direction of this Hon'ble Court, to the Respondent No.2 to not to disburse the compensation amount in respect of the S.No.38/7/A (old Gat.No.40/7) to the Respondent No.7;
(d) By an appropriate writ, order or direction of this Hon'ble Court, independent inquiry against the Respondent No.2 to 5 due to their joint and several liability registration of Deed No.5570 and Certificate of Sale dated 9th March, 2023 against the dead person as they cheats by pretending to be some other person, or by knowingly substituting one person for or another, or representing that he or such other person really is & as well as fraud, forgery and cheating, etc. with Petitioners.
(e) Pending the hearing and final disposal of the Petition the direction be given to Respondent No.2 that not to disburse the compensation amount in respect of the S.No.38/7/A (old Gat.No.40/7) to the Respondent No.7;
(f) Pending the hearing and final disposal of the Petition the directions be given to Respondent No.2 that the compensation amount with 9% interest from the date of Award to till date in respect of the S.No.38/7/A (old Gat No.40/7) to deposit in the Registry of this Hon'ble Court;"
3. Respondent No.7 is represented by Advocate Ms.Mangle.

